⭐ SQLReady v1.0.0 — Release Notes
🎉 Overview
SQLReady v1.0.0 is the first public release of the SQL Server upgrade‑readiness engine designed for defence, finance, and government estates.
This version introduces the full baseline workflow, diagnostics engine, migration blocker detection, BI stack checks, perf‑impact analysis, and structured evidence output.

It is read‑only, Citrix‑friendly, and suitable for SC‑cleared environments.

🚀 New in v1.0.0
🔍 Upgrade Readiness Engine
Deprecated feature detection

Version‑specific migration blockers

Compatibility level issues

Unsupported configuration checks

⚡ Performance Impact Analysis
Cardinality Estimator version detection

Memory grant pressure indicators

Plan regression risk signals

Query Store readiness checks

📊 BI Stack Compatibility
SSIS package format validation

SSRS catalog version checks

SSAS model compatibility checks

🛠 Diagnostics & Configuration
Config drift detection

Unsupported settings

Security posture indicators

Availability posture checks (AG/cluster)

📑 PRE/POST Baseline Engine
PRE baseline capture

POST baseline capture

Automatic delta comparison

CAB/cyber‑ready evidence output

🗄 SQLReady Repository
Repository schema creation

Views for reporting

Helper stored procedures

Structured findings and facts

