🔒 Security & Safety
SQLReady v1.0.0 is designed for secure estates:

Read‑only execution

No engine hooks

No configuration changes

No plan forcing

Safe for Citrix‑hosted SSMS

Suitable for SC‑cleared workflows

📦 Installation
Deploy the SQLReady repository using CreateRepository.sql

Run SQLReady.sql to generate findings

Capture PRE baseline

Perform upgrade

Capture POST baseline

Review delta report

